{
  "sn6.1:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 6.1 ",
  "sn6.1:0.2": "1. Paṭhamavagga ",
  "sn6.1:0.3": "Brahmāyācanasutta ",
  "sn6.1:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn6.1:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā uruvelāyaṁ viharati najjā nerañjarāya tīre ajapālanigrodhamūle paṭhamābhisambuddho. ",
  "sn6.1:1.3": "Atha kho bhagavato rahogatassa paṭisallīnassa evaṁ cetaso parivitakko udapādi: ",
  "sn6.1:1.4": "“adhigato kho myāyaṁ dhammo gambhīro duddaso duranubodho santo paṇīto atakkāvacaro nipuṇo paṇḍitavedanīyo. ",
  "sn6.1:1.5": "Ālayarāmā kho panāyaṁ pajā ālayaratā ālayasammuditā. ",
  "sn6.1:1.6": "Ālayarāmāya kho pana pajāya ālayaratāya ālayasammuditāya duddasaṁ idaṁ ṭhānaṁ yadidaṁ idappaccayatāpaṭiccasamuppādo. ",
  "sn6.1:1.7": "Idampi kho ṭhānaṁ duddasaṁ yadidaṁ sabbasaṅkhārasamatho sabbūpadhipaṭinissaggo taṇhākkhayo virāgo nirodho nibbānaṁ. ",
  "sn6.1:1.8": "Ahañceva kho pana dhammaṁ deseyyaṁ; pare ca me na ājāneyyuṁ; so mamassa kilamatho, sā mamassa vihesā”ti. ",
  "sn6.1:1.9": "Apissu bhagavantaṁ imā anacchariyā gāthāyo paṭibhaṁsu pubbe assutapubbā: ",
  "sn6.1:2.1": "“Kicchena me adhigataṁ, ",
  "sn6.1:2.2": "halaṁ dāni pakāsituṁ; ",
  "sn6.1:2.3": "Rāgadosaparetehi, ",
  "sn6.1:2.4": "nāyaṁ dhammo susambudho. ",
  "sn6.1:3.1": "Paṭisotagāmiṁ nipuṇaṁ, ",
  "sn6.1:3.2": "gambhīraṁ duddasaṁ aṇuṁ; ",
  "sn6.1:3.3": "Rāgarattā na dakkhanti, ",
  "sn6.1:3.4": "tamokh